# Build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile is the repo root. This file is
# the primary guarantee that no secret and no real invoice data ever enters
# an image layer, on top of the Dockerfile only COPYing explicit paths
# (never `COPY . .`). See design/DOCKER_DEPLOYMENT_PLAN.md §5/§12.
#
# Keep in sync with what the Dockerfile actually COPYs: package.json,
# pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml, web/package.json, tsconfig.json, src/,
# drizzle/, web/ (sources) must all remain reachable — do not broaden a
# pattern below to the point it swallows one of those.

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
web/dist

data/
.env*
*.env

.git
.venv
.pnpm-store
.secrets
.cognitron

design
docs
scratch
coverage

*.log
*.xlsx
.DS_Store
